msgid ""
"Analyzes TLS handshakes without decrypting traffic. Extracts SNI, "
"certificate details, cipher suites, and TLS fingerprints."
msgstr ""
"Analysiert TLS-Handshakes ohne Entschlüsselung des Verkehrs. Extrahiert SNI, "
