msgstr ""
"Jedes Fingerabdruck-Flag besitzt eine entsprechende `-file`-Variante zum "
"gemeinsamen Laden vieler Werte aus Dateien."

#: src/part2-local-capture/sniff.md:249
msgid "HTTP Capture"
msgstr "HTTP-Erfassung"

#: src/part2-local-capture/sniff.md:257
msgid ""
"Reconstructs HTTP request/response pairs from TCP streams with RTT "
"measurement."
msgstr ""
"Rekonstruiert HTTP-Anfrage-/Antwortpaare aus TCP-Streams und misst die RTT."

#: src/part2-local-capture/sniff.md:263
msgid "Filter by host pattern (glob)"
msgstr "Nach Hostmuster filtern (Glob)"

#: src/part2-local-capture/sniff.md:264
msgid "Filter by URL path pattern (glob)"
msgstr "Nach URL-Pfadmuster filtern (Glob)"

#: src/part2-local-capture/sniff.md:265
