msgstr "Hunter erfasst SIP- und RTP-Pakete"

#: src/part3-distributed/hunt.md:210
msgid "Packets are buffered locally, grouped by SIP Call-ID"
msgstr "Pakete werden lokal nach SIP Call-ID gruppiert gepuffert"

