msgid ""
"**Hunters** use SIP TCP idle-timeout tuning and processor-managed filters, "
"but do not expose `--tcp-performance-mode`."
msgstr ""
"**Hunter** verwenden SIP-TCP-Leerlauf-Timeouts und prozessorverwaltete "
