#: src/part5-advanced/tls.md:74
msgid ""
"These fields are concatenated and MD5-hashed to produce a 32-character "
"fingerprint. Because different applications construct their ClientHello "
"differently (different cipher suite orderings, different extensions), the "
"JA3 fingerprint identifies the client software regardless of IP address."
