msgid "RTP and SRTP Media Streams"
msgstr "RTP- und SRTP-Medienströme"

#: src/part5-advanced/voip.md:128
msgid ""
"Once a SIP dialog is established, media flows as RTP (Real-time Transport "
"Protocol) packets. lippycat detects RTP streams by identifying packets "
"within configured port ranges (default: 10000-32768) that match the RTP "
"header structure."
